def predict(board_lines, action):
    """
    Complete deterministic prediction for the supplied level.

    This restores the replay-verified 19/20 approximation.
    The disproved all-white-canvas timer exception has been removed.
    Transition 4 remains unresolved: its complete input board, compared
    with transition 6's input board, is needed for a justified repair.
